t agentId",description:"Label text displayed above or as placeholder text in an agent ID input field in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface. Shown as a form field label or placeholder. The purpose is to prompt users to enter an agent ID, which is used for local development and testing of AI agents."},modalTitle:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.modal-title",defaultMessage:"Local Components",description:"Title text displayed at the top of a modal dialog in the AI conversation interface that provides access to local frontend development components and tools. Shown as the modal dialog header title. The purpose is to immediately communicate to developers that this modal contains local development utilities and testing tools."},closeLocalComponentsLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.close-label",defaultMessage:"Close local components",description:"Button label displayed on the close button in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it closes the modal dialog. The purpose is to provide users with a way to exit the local components modal."},agentEmbedButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.agent-embed-button-label",defaultMessage:"Agent Embed",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface that demonstrates or tests agent embedding functionality. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it shows an example or test of how an agent can be embedded in other applications. The purpose is to provide developers with a way to test agent embedding features during local development."},pubsubEventsButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.pubsub-events-button-label",defaultMessage:"Pubsub Events",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface that demonstrates or tests pubsub (publish-subscribe) event functionality. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it shows an example or test of pubsub events. The purpose is to provide developers with a way to test event publishing and subscription features during local development."},callAnApiButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.call-an-api-button-label",defaultMessage:"Call an API",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface that demonstrates or tests API calling functionality. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it shows an example or test of making API calls. The purpose is to provide developers with a way to test API integration features during local development."},simulatedFullscreenButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.simulated-fullscreen-button-label",defaultMessage:"Simulate fullscreen",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the local frontend components modal within the AI conversation interface that simulates a fullscreen view of the chat interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it expands the chat interface to simulate a fullscreen experience. The purpose is to provide developers with a way to test the fullscreen UI layout during local development."},closeSimulatedFullscreenButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.close-simulated-fullscreen-button-label",defaultMessage:"Close simulated fullscreen",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the simulated fullscreen view within the AI conversation interface that exits the fullscreen simulation. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it closes the fullscreen simulation and returns to the normal view. The purpose is to provide users with a way to exit the fullscreen view."},createReleaseButtonLabel:{id:"ai-mate.local-frontend-components.create-release-button-label",defaultMessage:"Create Jira Release",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the local frontend comp